==German==
{{was fwotd|de|2019|May|10}}

===Etymology===
{{af|de|Sonntag|-s-|Schrift|t1=Sunday|t3=writing}}

The sense “tidy handwriting” was probably formed following {{m|de|Sonntagskleidung|t=Sunday best}}, from the aspect of tidiness.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈzɔntaksˌʃʁɪft/}}
* {{hyphenation|de|Sonn|tags|schrift}}

